{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52745","headline":"丹元子步天歌 南方七宿 六 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 南方七宿 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翼，二十二星大难识。\n上五下五横着行，中心六个恰如张。\n更有六星在何许？三三相连张畔附。\n必若不能分处所，更请向前看野取。\n五个黑星翼下头。\n欲知名字是东瓯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}